Sun -> SunCorona $OBJ
TexturesGG [ ] Textures $OBJ margin=0.1
TexturesGGWip WIP, from shadertoy ; URL="https://www.shadertoy.com/view/tltXWM"
TexturesGG -> TexturesGGWip
note_textures_gg I'm having issues with the scaling, for some reason vertical movement of the viewframe affects the scaling applied to the texture ; $NOTE
TexturesGGWip -> note_textures_gg $SUBTLE
GasGiant -> TexturesGG $OBJ
TexturesIG [ ] Textures $OBJ margin=0.1
IceGiant -> TexturesIG $OBJ
