// Activity and events
Events 📚 Events ; $MAIN


Activity -> Events triggers list of


AttackSoS Attack:\nShip-on-ship
Events -> AttackSoS ; $CLOSE
Events -> Trading ; $CLOSE
Events -> Mining ; $CLOSE
NewStation New station
Events -> NewStation ; $CLOSE
GovernmentSwitch Government\nSwitch
Events -> GovernmentSwitch ; $CLOSE
GovernmentSwitch -> Government
MilitaryAction Military\naction
Events -> MilitaryAction ; $CLOSE
MilitaryAction -> Government ; $INDIRECT
Government -> MilitaryAction likelihood\ndepends on type


GovernmentSwitch -> note_gvt $SUBTLE
MilitaryAction -> note_mil_act $SUBTLE
NewStation -> note_new_sta $SUBTLE

note_gvt Government type will switch depending on, for example, the amount of military ships. If that is too low, the government can flip from A to B (with not all options present, and some more likely depending on A); $NOTE


note_mil_act Military actions will be more/less likely depending on source and target government, and number of military ships locally ; $NOTE


note_new_sta A new station may appear depending on system thresholds (economy, piracy, military) ; $NOTE